@startuml ContainerDiagram
title C4 - Container Diagram (v1)

actor "Usuario" as user
actor "Administrador/Dev" as dev

rectangle "Fuente de Video\n(RTSP / Webcam / Archivo)" as video

rectangle "Frontend Dashboard\n(React + Vite)" as fe
rectangle "Backend API\n(FastAPI + WebSocket)" as be
rectangle "Vision Engine\n(Python + YOLO + Tracking)" as ve
rectangle "Redis Streams" as redis
rectangle "PostgreSQL" as db

user --> fe : Interactúa / visualiza
fe --> be : REST / WebSocket

dev --> be : Configura / monitorea
dev --> ve : Configura / monitorea

video --> ve : Frames

ve --> redis : Publica eventos\n(detecciones/tracking)
be --> redis : Consume eventos\n(agregación)

be --> db : Persiste métricas\n(sesiones/históricos)
be --> fe : Push real-time\n(métricas + boxes)

note right of redis
Mensajería para desacoplar
procesamiento y consumo.
end note

note right of db
Persistencia de métricas agregadas.
No se almacenan frames ni video.
end note

@enduml